# DianaSh golden corpus. Recorded from the C# shell, byte for byte; EMUSEN_DIANASH_GOLDEN=record rewrites it - see EmuSen_DianaSh.md §13.4.
# Patterns: <ROOT> is the sandbox's real root, <TEMP> the corpus's real temporary folder, <INSTALL> the install's real directory;
# a 'match' block is a regular expression the whole output must match, written where a line prints a time or a measured number.
command freeze
usage 1   freeze add <space> <addr> [<value>]  pin <addr>; without <value>, at whatever it holds now
usage 2   freeze list                          list frozen addresses and how many writes each blocked
usage 3   freeze remove <id>                   unfreeze one address
usage 4   freeze clear                         unfreeze everything

case pinned addresses
target fake
covers 1-4
$ freeze
out 39
Usage: freeze add|list|remove|clear ...
status 0
action none
$ freeze list
out 20
No frozen addresses.
status 0
action none
$ freeze add
out 42
Usage: freeze add <space> <addr> [<value>]
status 0
action none
$ freeze add RAM 10
out 27
Frozen #1: RAM 0x10 = 0x73.
status 0
action none
$ freeze add RAM 11 7
out 27
Frozen #2: RAM 0x11 = 0x07.
status 0
action none
$ freeze add ROM 0
out 61
ROM is not writable, so nothing can write to it to be undone.
status 1
action none
$ echo $?
out 1
1
status 0
action none
$ freeze add RAM 100
out 32
0x100 is outside RAM (0x0-0xFF).
status 1
action none
$ echo $?
out 1
1
status 0
action none
$ freeze add RAM -1 1
out 64
Error: String cannot contain a minus sign if the base is not 10.
status 1
action none
$ freeze add NOPE 0
out 83
Error: No memory space named 'NOPE'. Available: RAM, ROM, VRAM, IO, UNSIZED, CpuBus
status 1
action none
$ freeze list
out 83
  #1: RAM 0x10 = 0x73 (0 write(s) undone)
  #2: RAM 0x11 = 0x07 (0 write(s) undone)
status 0
action none
$ freeze remove
out 25
Usage: freeze remove <id>
status 0
action none
$ freeze remove 1
out 27
Frozen address #1 released.
status 0
action none
$ freeze remove 1
out 21
No frozen address #1.
status 1
action none
$ echo $?
out 1
1
status 0
action none
$ freeze clear
out 30
1 frozen address(es) released.
status 0
action none
$ freeze list
out 20
No frozen addresses.
status 0
action none
$ freeze frob
out 62
Unknown 'freeze' subcommand 'frob'. Try add/list/remove/clear.
status 0
action none
end

case a bare target
target bare
covers 1
$ freeze list
out 44
This core does not support frozen addresses.
status 1
action none
$ echo $?
out 1
1
status 0
action none
end

case with no target
target none
covers 1
$ freeze list
out 58
No ROM loaded - this command needs an active debug target.
status 1
action none
$ echo $?
out 1
1
status 0
action none
end
